  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2308.17 Revocation of Vessel Agent Authority.\n\n(a) The commissioner shall revoke a vessel agent’s authority, after a hearing, for failure to adhere to the contract or for any violation of this chapter or RSA 270-E.\n\n(b) All hearings shall be held in accordance with the requirements of Saf-C 200.\n\nSource. #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2308.15) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATUTE\n\nSaf-C 2301.01 - Saf-C 2301.02 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2301.03 | RSA 270-D:1, I\n\nSaf-C 2301.04 - Saf-C 2301.05 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2301.06 | RSA 270-E:2, II\n\nSaf-C 2301.07 | RSA 270-E:2, III\n\nSaf-C 2301.08 | RSA 541-A:7; RSA 270-E:2, V\n\nSaf-C 2301.09 | RSA 270-D:1, IV\n\nSaf-C 2301.10 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2301.11 | RSA 270-E:13, I; RSA 270-E:16, I\n\nSaf-C 2301.12 – Saf-C 2301.13 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2301.14 | RSA 270-E:2, VII\n\nSaf-C 2301.15 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2301.16 | RSA 270-E:2, X\n\nSaf-C 2301.17 | RSA 270-E:5-a\n\nSaf-C 2301.18 - Saf-C2301.19 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2301.20 | RSA 270-E:2, XII\n\nSaf-C 2301.21 | RSA 270-E:3, VIII\n\nSaf-C 2301.22 | RSA 270-E:2, IX\n\nSaf-C 2301.23 | RSA 270-E:12, III; RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 2302.01 | RSA 270-E:3; RSA 270-E:4\n\nSaf-C 2302.02 – Saf-C 2302.03 | RSA 270-E:3\n\nSaf-C 2302.02 - Saf-C 2302.04 | RSA 72-A; RSA 270-E:3; RSA 270-E:4; RSA 270-E:5; RSA 270-E:6\n\nSaf-C 2302.05 – Saf-C 2302.09 | RSA 270-E:3; RSA 270-E:5-a\n\nSaf-C 2303.01 – Saf-C 2303.02 | RSA 270-E:8; RSA 270-E:9\n\nSaf-C 2304.01 – Saf-C 2304.04 | RSA 270-E:3; RSA 270-E:8, III; RSA 270-E:9, II\n\nSaf-C 2305.01 | RSA 270-E:10; RSA 270-E:11; RSA 270-E:12\n\nSaf-C 2306.01 – Saf-C 306.04 | RSA 270-E:5, III; RSA 270-E:13\n\nSaf-C 2307.01 – Saf-C 2307.04 | RSA 270-E:5, II-III; RSA 270-E:16\n\nSaf-C 2308.01 – Saf-C 2308.06 | RSA 270-E:3, VIII\n\nSaf-C 2308.07 | RSA 72-A:4, I(a); RSA 270-E:3, VIII\n\nSaf-C 2308.08 | RSA 270-E:3, VIII\n\nSaf-C 2308.09 – Saf-C 2308.10 | RSA 72-A:4, III; RSA 270-E:3, VIII; RSA 270-E:5, II(c);\n\nSaf-C 2308.11 – Saf-C 2308.17 | RSA 270-E:3, VIII",
